{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover one of Japan's most iconic districts with <i>\u201cShops of Shibuya\u201d</i> created by community creator <i>\u2018Stop it D</i>\u2019. This Content Creator Pack brings the broad selection of the area to your city, with sleek storefronts, bustling boulevards, and tucked-away sidestreets known only to locals and fashion-forward visitors. Featuring a mix of low and high-density commercial buildings, unique buildings, and parks, this pack captures the energy of a trendy fashion district.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2018Shops of Shibuya\u2019 includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Unique Buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Parks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 Low Density Commercial growables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 High Density Commercial growables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >47 Props</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This pack can be bought as part of the <strong>\u2018Shops of Shibuya Bundle\u2019\u00a0</strong>containing <strong>\u2018Shops of Shibuya\u2019</strong>, <strong>\u2018Map Pack 4\u2019</strong>, and <strong>\u2018Harumi Nights FM\u2019</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3731500?t=1757491161","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731500/6c752a336523d5c662fb005895d11c8f8cf3fbfa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757491161","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731500/55e116ee78c80c246b12e97db2e71f3bfdfee387/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757491161","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731500/55e116ee78c80c246b12e97db2e71f3bfdfee387/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757491161","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"de